Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Type "python install_skill.py --env frontend --best --target /tmp/demo-skills"
Enter
Sleep 2500ms

Type "tail -6 skills/frontend/google_gemini-2.5-flash-lite/summary.txt"
Enter
Sleep 4500ms
